&lt;p&gt;I'm passionate about exploring technology, building creative projects, and learning new skills. So far, I've worked on an ultrasonic smart walking stick, a hand gesture recognition system, Conway's Game of Life, and a Forensic Investigation game.&lt;/p&gt;

